// QNMF Pillar 6: Verification & Abstention Layer
// Evaluates candidate outputs: arithmetic parity, grid state transitions, logic invariants
// Returns: 0=VERIFIED, 1=ABSTAIN, 2=RETRY

network VerifyLayerNet ⟦
    dense ⟬4⸴ 8⟭ ·
    relu ·
    dense ⟬8⸴ 3⟭ ·
⟧

process main⦅⦆ → int64 ⟦
    emit "VERIFY_LAYER_SPEC_INITIALIZED" ·
    yield 0 ·
⟧
